{"paragraphs":[{"text":"%md\r\n# 📝 Lista de Exercícios - SparkSQL com os DataFrames Innocent Deaths caused by Police (All time)\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://www.kaggle.com/datasets/kannan1314/innocent-deaths-caused-by-police-all-time/\r\n\r\nNeste exercício, você vai praticar operações básicas e intermediárias no PySpark usando um DataFrame que une dados de mortes de individuos após encontros com policiais nos EUA, os dados são disponibilizadpos pela https://fatalencounters.org/ \r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n#### 📁 1. Leitura dos dados do MinIO\r\nLeia os arquivos CSV usando Spark e crie DataFrames.\r\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T21:20:05+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h1>📝 Lista de Exercícios - SparkSQL com os DataFrames Innocent Deaths caused by Police (All time)</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/kannan1314/innocent-deaths-caused-by-police-all-time/\">https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/kannan1314/innocent-deaths-caused-by-police-all-time/</a></p>\n<p>Neste exercício, você vai praticar operações básicas e intermediárias no PySpark usando um DataFrame que une dados de mortes de individuos após encontros com policiais nos EUA, os dados são disponibilizadpos pela <a href=\"https://fatalencounters.org/\">https://fatalencounters.org/</a></p>\n<hr />\n<h4>📁 1. Leitura dos dados do MinIO</h4>\n<p>Leia os arquivos CSV usando Spark e crie DataFrames.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746739205495_721862946","id":"paragraph_1744823081768_576419329","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T21:20:05+0000","status":"READY","focus":true},{"text":"%pyspark\n#Resposta questão 1 e 2\nfiles = [\n    \"agencies\",\n    \"incidents\",\n    \"locations\",\n    \"victims\"\n]\n\n\nbase_path = \"s3a://bucket-teste/incidents/\" \n\nfor file in files:\n    file_path = f\"{base_path}{file}.csv\"\n    \n    df = spark.read \\\n        .option(\"header\", \"true\") \\\n        .option(\"inferSchema\", \"true\") \\\n        .csv(file_path)\n    \n    view_name = file.replace(\".csv\", \"\")\n    df.createOrReplaceTempView(view_name)\n    \n    print(f\"\\n=== View criada: {view_name} ===\")\n    print(\"Schema:\")\n    df.printSchema()\n    print(f\"Número de linhas: {df.count()}\")\n    print(\"Exemplo de dados:\")\n    df.show(5, truncate=False)\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T21:29:59+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":false,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{"jobUrl":{"propertyName":"jobUrl","label":"SPARK JOB","tooltip":"View in Spark web UI","group":"spark","values":[{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=37"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=37"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=38"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=38"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=39"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=39"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=40"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=40"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=41"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=41"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=42"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=42"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=43"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=43"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=44"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=44"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=45"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=45"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=46"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=46"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=47"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=47"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=48"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=48"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=49"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=49"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=50"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=50"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=51"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=51"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=52"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=52"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=53"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=53"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=54"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=54"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=55"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=55"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=56"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=56"}],"interpreterSettingId":"spark"}},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746739214868_709800834","id":"paragraph_1746739214868_709800834","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T21:20:14+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":false,"dateFinished":"2025-05-08T21:27:19+0000","dateStarted":"2025-05-08T21:27:13+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"\n=== View criada: agencies ===\nSchema:\nroot\n |-- unique_id: integer (nullable = true)\n |-- agency_name: string (nullable = true)\n\nNúmero de linhas: 30860\nExemplo de dados:\n+---------+---------------------------------+\n|unique_id|agency_name                      |\n+---------+---------------------------------+\n|25747    |null                             |\n|25748    |null                             |\n|25746    |Mendocino County Sheriff's Office|\n|25749    |Eddy County Sheriff's Office     |\n|1        |Sacramento Police Department     |\n+---------+---------------------------------+\nonly showing top 5 rows\n\n\n=== View criada: incidents ===\nSchema:\nroot\n |-- unique_id: string (nullable = true)\n |-- incident_date: string (nullable = true)\n |-- agency_or_agencies_involved: string (nullable = true)\n |-- highest_level_of_force: string (nullable = true)\n |-- alleged_weapon: string (nullable = true)\n |-- aggressive_physical_movement: string (nullable = true)\n |-- fleeing_status: string (nullable = true)\n |-- disposition: string (nullable = true)\n |-- intended_force: string (nullable = true)\n |-- document_link: string (nullable = true)\n |-- mental_illness_known: string (nullable = true)\n |-- description: string (nullable = true)\n\nNúmero de linhas: 30861\nExemplo de dados:\n+---------+-------------+---------------------------------+----------------------+--------------+----------------------------+--------------+-----------+--------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+--------------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|unique_id|incident_date|agency_or_agencies_involved      |highest_level_of_force|alleged_weapon|aggressive_physical_movement|fleeing_status|disposition|intended_force|document_link                                                                     |mental_illness_known|description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |\n+---------+-------------+---------------------------------+----------------------+--------------+----------------------------+--------------+-----------+--------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+--------------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|25747    |1/1/2000     |null                             |Vehicle               |null          |null                        |null          |Unreported |Pursuit       |https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-nK-RohgiM-tZ5QV0fKOefRUbwJDRD6i/view?usp=sharing|No                  |Two Detroit men killed when their car crashed were among at least eight people who died in New Year's holiday weekend traffic accidents in Michigan, police said. Mark A Horton, 21, and passenger Phillip A. Bluebridge, 19, were killed when their car crashed in their hometown at 1:54 a.m. They were not wearing seat belts. While these deaths were not reported in news media as police pursuit deaths, National Highway Traffic Safety Administration data shows police reported two people dying in a police pursuit at 1:54 a.m. on January 1, 2000, on Davison Freeway. It was the only double fatality crash in Michigan that night.|\n|25748    |1/1/2000     |null                             |Vehicle               |null          |null                        |null          |Unreported |Pursuit       |https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-nK-RohgiM-tZ5QV0fKOefRUbwJDRD6i/view?usp=sharing|No                  |Two Detroit men killed when their car crashed were among at least eight people who died in New Year's holiday weekend traffic accidents in Michigan, police said. Mark A Horton, 21, and passenger Phillip A. Blurbridge, 19, were killed when their car crashed in their hometown at 1:54 a.m. They were not wearing seat belts. While these deaths were not reported in news media as police pursuit deaths, National Highway Traffic Safety Administration data shows police reported two people dying in a police pursuit at 1:54 a.m. on January 1, 2000, on Davison Freeway. It was the only double fatality crash in Michigan that night.|\n|25746    |1/1/2000     |Mendocino County Sheriff's Office|Vehicle               |null          |null                        |null          |Unreported |Pursuit       |https://drive.google.com/file/d/10DisrV8K5ReP1lUkqo4y7krqc5Z__rtx/view?usp=sharing|No                  |Samuel Knapp was allegedly driving a stolen vehicle when Deputies Scott Nording and Mike Davis started to pursue him. He crashed and was killed during the pursuit about 12:35 a.m.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |\n|25749    |1/1/2000     |Eddy County Sheriff's Office     |Vehicle               |null          |null                        |null          |Unreported |Pursuit       |https://drive.google.com/file/d/1qAEefRjX_aTtCIffqMJm18P4kf-BZn52/view?usp=sharing|No                  |A motorcycle was allegedly being driven erratically when a deputy began to pursue. The motorcycle crashed, killing the driver, Mark Ortiz.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |\n|1        |1/2/2000     |Sacramento Police Department     |Vehicle               |null          |null                        |null          |Unknown    |Pursuit       |http://www.recordnet.com/article/20000110/A_NEWS/301109998                        |No                  |LaTanya Janelle McCoy's car was struck from behind by a car fleeing police. She died in her car, which was engulfed in flames as police and the other driver engaged in a shootout in south Sacramento.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |\n+---------+-------------+---------------------------------+----------------------+--------------+----------------------------+--------------+-----------+--------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+--------------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\nonly showing top 5 rows\n\n\n=== View criada: locations ===\nSchema:\nroot\n |-- unique_id: string (nullable = true)\n |-- injury_address: string (nullable = true)\n |-- death_city: string (nullable = true)\n |-- state: string (nullable = true)\n |-- death_zip: double (nullable = true)\n |-- death_county: string (nullable = true)\n |-- full_address: string (nullable = true)\n |-- latitude: string (nullable = true)\n |-- longitude: double (nullable = true)\n\nNúmero de linhas: 30861\nExemplo de dados:\n+---------+--------------------+----------+-----+---------+------------+---------------------------------------------------+----------+------------+\n|unique_id|injury_address      |death_city|state|death_zip|death_county|full_address                                       |latitude  |longitude   |\n+---------+--------------------+----------+-----+---------+------------+---------------------------------------------------+----------+------------+\n|25747    |Davison Freeway     |Detroit   |MI   |48203.0  |Wayne       |Davison Freeway Detroit MI 48203 Wayne             |42.4045258|-83.0922741 |\n|25748    |Davison Freeway     |Detroit   |MI   |48203.0  |Wayne       |Davison Freeway Detroit MI 48203 Wayne             |42.4045258|-83.0922741 |\n|25746    |27898-27804 US-101  |Willits   |CA   |95490.0  |Mendocino   |27898-27804 US-101 Willits CA 95490 Mendocino      |39.4708829|-123.3617513|\n|25749    |600 W Cherry Ln     |Carlsbad  |NM   |88220.0  |Eddy        |600 W Cherry Ln Carlsbad NM 88220 Eddy             |32.4500798|-104.2376427|\n|1        |5700 block Mack Road|Sacramento|CA   |95823.0  |Sacramento  |5700 block Mack Road Sacramento CA 95823 Sacramento|38.4739487|-121.4337757|\n+---------+--------------------+----------+-----+---------+------------+---------------------------------------------------+----------+------------+\nonly showing top 5 rows\n\n\n=== View criada: victims ===\nSchema:\nroot\n |-- unique_id: string (nullable = true)\n |-- name: string (nullable = true)\n |-- age: string (nullable = true)\n |-- gender: string (nullable = true)\n |-- race: string (nullable = true)\n |-- image_url: string (nullable = true)\n\nNúmero de linhas: 30866\nExemplo de dados:\n+---------+---------------------+---+------+-----------------------+---------+\n|unique_id|name                 |age|gender|race                   |image_url|\n+---------+---------------------+---+------+-----------------------+---------+\n|25747    |Mark A. Horton       |21 |Male  |African-American/Black |null     |\n|25748    |Phillip A. Blurbridge|19 |Male  |African-American/Black |null     |\n|25746    |Samuel H. Knapp      |17 |Male  |European-American/White|null     |\n|25749    |Mark Ortiz           |23 |Male  |Hispanic/Latino        |null     |\n|1        |LaTanya Janelle McCoy|24 |Female|African-American/Black |null     |\n+---------+---------------------+---+------+-----------------------+---------+\nonly showing top 5 rows\n\n"}]}},{"text":"%md\n### 🗃️ 2. Criação das tabelas temporárias para consultas SQL\nCrie views temporárias com os DataFrames lidos.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T21:20:05+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>🗃️ 2. Criação das tabelas temporárias para consultas SQL</h3>\n<p>Crie views temporárias com os DataFrames lidos.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746739205496_1656831487","id":"paragraph_1744823910026_1386567614","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T21:20:05+0000","status":"READY"},{"text":"%md\n### 🔍 3. Quantas vítimas têm em cada gênero? 👩‍🦰👨‍🦱","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T21:20:05+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>🔍 3. Quantas vítimas têm em cada gênero? 👩‍🦰👨‍🦱</h3>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746739205496_1951618268","id":"paragraph_1744824262776_2030657270","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T21:20:05+0000","status":"READY"},{"text":"%spark.sql\n    SELECT \n        gender,\n        COUNT(*) AS Quantidade\n    FROM victims\n    WHERE gender IS NOT NULL\n    GROUP BY gender\n    ORDER BY Quantidade DESC\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T21:29:19+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"sql","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":false,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{"jobUrl":{"propertyName":"jobUrl","label":"SPARK JOB","tooltip":"View in Spark web UI","group":"spark","values":[{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=57"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=57"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=58"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=58"}],"interpreterSettingId":"spark"}},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746739726423_676334640","id":"paragraph_1746739726423_676334640","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T21:28:46+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":false,"dateFinished":"2025-05-08T21:29:20+0000","dateStarted":"2025-05-08T21:29:19+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TABLE","data":"gender\tQuantidade\nMale\t27739\nFemale\t2957\nTransgender\t22\n"}]}},{"text":"%md\n### 📈 4. Qual o ano com mais incidentes registrados? ","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T21:20:05+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>📈 4. Qual o ano com mais incidentes registrados?</h3>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746739205496_1993889173","id":"paragraph_1744824468078_858878104","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T21:20:05+0000","status":"READY"},{"text":"%spark.sql\n    SELECT \n        SUBSTRING(incident_date, -4) AS Ano,\n        COUNT(*) AS Total_Incidentes\n    FROM incidents\n    WHERE incident_date IS NOT NULL AND LENGTH(incident_date) >= 4\n    GROUP BY Ano\n    ORDER BY Total_Incidentes DESC\n    LIMIT 5","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T21:30:13+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"sql","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{"jobUrl":{"propertyName":"jobUrl","label":"SPARK JOB","tooltip":"View in Spark web UI","group":"spark","values":[{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=59"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=59"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=60"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=60"}],"interpreterSettingId":"spark"}},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746739801448_1176748195","id":"paragraph_1746739801448_1176748195","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T21:30:01+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":false,"dateFinished":"2025-05-08T21:30:14+0000","dateStarted":"2025-05-08T21:30:13+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TABLE","data":"Ano\tTotal_Incidentes\n2020\t2081\n2018\t1861\n2019\t1825\n2013\t1777\n2017\t1772\n"}]}},{"text":"%md\n### 🧠 5. Quantas vítimas tinham algum caso mental conhecido?","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T21:20:05+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>🧠 5. Quantas vítimas tinham algum caso mental conhecido?</h3>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746739205496_1527307503","id":"paragraph_1744824595436_1287737097","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T21:20:05+0000","status":"READY"},{"text":"%spark.sql\n    SELECT \n        count(distinct(v.unique_id))\n    FROM victims v\n    JOIN incidents i ON v.unique_id = i.unique_id\n    WHERE i.mental_illness_known = 'Yes'","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T21:31:18+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"sql","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":false,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{"jobUrl":{"propertyName":"jobUrl","label":"SPARK JOB","tooltip":"View in Spark web UI","group":"spark","values":[{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=64"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=64"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=65"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=65"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=66"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=66"}],"interpreterSettingId":"spark"}},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746739845064_1224791241","id":"paragraph_1746739845064_1224791241","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T21:30:45+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":false,"dateFinished":"2025-05-08T21:31:19+0000","dateStarted":"2025-05-08T21:31:18+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TABLE","data":"count(DISTINCT unique_id)\n3376\n"}]}},{"text":"%md\n### 🌍 6. Liste as 5 cidades com maior número de incidentes","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T21:20:05+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>🌍 6. Liste as 5 cidades com maior número de incidentes</h3>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746739205496_1361341311","id":"paragraph_1744824993911_1939793442","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T21:20:05+0000","status":"READY"},{"text":"%spark.sql\n    SELECT \n        l.death_city AS Cidade,\n        l.state AS Estado,\n        COUNT(*) AS Total_Incidentes\n    FROM incidents i\n    JOIN locations l ON i.unique_id = l.unique_id\n    WHERE l.death_city IS NOT NULL\n    GROUP BY l.death_city, l.state\n    ORDER BY Total_Incidentes DESC\n    LIMIT 5","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T21:32:15+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"sql","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":false,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{"jobUrl":{"propertyName":"jobUrl","label":"SPARK JOB","tooltip":"View in Spark web UI","group":"spark","values":[{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=71"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=71"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=72"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=72"}],"interpreterSettingId":"spark"}},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746739927449_627125329","id":"paragraph_1746739927449_627125329","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T21:32:07+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":false,"dateFinished":"2025-05-08T21:32:15+0000","dateStarted":"2025-05-08T21:32:15+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TABLE","data":"Cidade\tEstado\tTotal_Incidentes\nHouston\tTX\t480\nChicago\tIL\t465\nLos Angeles\tCA\t420\nPhoenix\tAZ\t272\nSan Antonio\tTX\t253\n"}]}},{"text":"%md\n### 🔗 7. Nome e cidade de vítimas que sofreram incidentes com força letal ☠️\n🎯 Objetivo: Usar JOIN entre victims, incidents e locations para listar o nome da vítima, idade e cidade onde o incidente com uso intencional de força letal ocorreu.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T21:20:05+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h3>🔗 7. Nome e cidade de vítimas que sofreram incidentes com força letal ☠️</h3>\n<p>🎯 Objetivo: Usar JOIN entre victims, incidents e locations para listar o nome da vítima, idade e cidade onde o incidente com uso intencional de força letal ocorreu.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746739205497_32577224","id":"paragraph_1744825032413_1732959195","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T21:20:05+0000","status":"READY"},{"text":"%spark.sql\n    SELECT \n        v.name as Nome,\n        v.age AS Idade,\n        l.death_city AS Cidade,\n        l.state AS Estado,\n        i.highest_level_of_force AS Nivel_Forca,\n        i.intended_force AS Intencao_Forca\n    FROM victims v\n    JOIN incidents i ON v.unique_id = i.unique_id\n    JOIN locations l ON v.unique_id = l.unique_id\n    WHERE i.highest_level_of_force = 'Deadly%' \n       OR i.intended_force LIKE '%Deadly%'\n    ORDER BY l.death_city, v.name","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T21:34:26+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"sql","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{"jobUrl":{"propertyName":"jobUrl","label":"SPARK JOB","tooltip":"View in Spark web UI","group":"spark","values":[{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=84"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=84"}],"interpreterSettingId":"spark"}},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746739905808_207861928","id":"paragraph_1746739905808_207861928","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T21:31:45+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":false,"dateFinished":"2025-05-08T21:34:26+0000","dateStarted":"2025-05-08T21:34:26+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TABLE","data":"Nome\tIdade\tCidade\tEstado\tNivel_Forca\tIntencao_Forca\n\"Raymond \"\"Eddie\"\" Flanagan\"\t38\tnull\tIN\tGunshot\tDeadly force\nBobby Lee Manseill Jr.\t37\tnull\tMS\tGunshot\tD